  "name": "Conjure Animals",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A Large pack of spectral animals. Whenever it moves within 10 ft of an enemy, or an enemy enters a space within 10 ft of it or ends its turn there, that enemy makes a DEX save or takes 3d10 Slashing (+1d10 per slot level above 3rd), once per turn. You have Advantage on STR saves within 5 ft of the pack (the DM applies that). Move the pack up to 30 ft when you move.</p>",
